                "databaseId": 3976252036,
                "body": "This case does not enter the child budget scope: `query` parses before calling `query_prepared_with_budget` (`lib.rs:1022-1023`), so `\"not SPARQL\"` returns before `with_budget` is installed. Use a syntactically valid but unsupported query such as `CONSTRUCT { ?s ?p ?o } WHERE {}` so the callback exercises restoration after an inner execution error.",
