              {
                "databaseId": 3976252068,
                "body": "The public `QueryBudget` contract now includes nested-call behavior, but `skills/sparql-query/SKILL.md` still documents only the limits and error strings, not that callbacks get an independent budget and the outer limits/sticky error resume after child errors or unwind. The repository maintenance rule in `AGENTS.md:90` requires updating the matching skill when a public surface changes; add this behavior there.",
